WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:03.417
Do you hear that?

00:00:03.875 --> 00:00:04.792
What’s going on?

00:00:05.041 --> 00:00:05.917
That’s a good question.

00:00:11.417 --> 00:00:12.542
There’s got to be an explanation.

00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:13.542
Know we oughtta do?

00:00:13.542 --> 00:00:14.042
Yes, sir.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.875
You wanted to make history, so maybe this is your chance.

00:00:20.542 --> 00:00:23.417
There are things that you can feel and not describe.

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:32.834
Over the course of a law-man’s life, he comes to understand
why he was chosen.

00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:39.250
Owwww

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.333
Where are you taking me?

00:00:40.542 --> 00:00:41.417
A new world.

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:43.542
Hi, fellas.

00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:44.375
I’ll go in three…

00:00:44.417 --> 00:00:44.875
Two…

00:00:44.875 --> 00:00:45.458
One.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:46.166
Launch!

00:00:47.166 --> 00:00:48.750
Oh my God, it’s so great, isn’t it?

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:50.625
It is gorgeous up there!

00:00:50.959 --> 00:00:53.291
TELL ME!

00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:57.500
Oh no, it’s a song.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.917
This is my Beach Boys song.

00:00:59.166 --> 00:00:59.792
Wouldn’t it be nice?

00:00:59.834 --> 00:01:00.625
Boom!

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:06.458
You’re the girl with the deaf family, and you sing?

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.250
Here they come.

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:10.500
You’re it for me.

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:11.834
I feel the same way.

00:01:12.917 --> 00:01:14.875
When she sleeps, she turns into a wolf.

00:01:18.959 --> 00:01:20.083
I’m begging you to come back to me.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:23.291
The world deserves to see this.

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:25.959
I do believe you have just had a breakthrough.

00:01:26.166 --> 00:01:27.500
We fight for freedom.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.417
Only we can shorten the darkness.

00:01:33.583 --> 00:01:35.291
Hey, it’s a story.

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:43.250
We’ve been working really well together.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:45.375
This is unbelievable!

00:01:45.458 --> 00:01:46.500
So, what do you do?

00:01:46.583 --> 00:01:47.583
I teach fifth grade.

00:01:47.667 --> 00:01:49.166
Shut up, I love you.

00:01:51.792 --> 00:01:54.500
I think we’ve all had enough of this amuse-bouche.

00:01:54.542 --> 00:01:56.583
Time to move onto the main course.

